# Set api_token to the configured CASHIER_API_TOKEN in your REST client.
@server = http://localhost:3000

### Standalone snapshot (use the configured BEANCOUNT_FILE basename)
GET {{server}}/infrastructure?file_path=main.bean
Authorization: Bearer {{api_token}}

### Ping
GET {{server}}/ping
Authorization: Bearer {{api_token}}

### Health (no token required)
GET {{server}}/health
